# Client-side (public by design - the publishable/anon key is safe to ship; row level security protects the data).
# NEVER put the secret / service_role key here: everything prefixed VITE_ is bundled into the app.
# Leave both empty to run on this device only (no sign-in, nothing leaves the browser).
# Steps to get the values: docs/SERVER_SETUP.md
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# v1 has no paid AI and no third-party API keys (docs/README.md, scope change 2026-10-01).
# The server needs no secrets of its own: account deletion is a database function, not an Edge Function.
